  "content": "[Intro]\n[F#]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[F#]You keep saying,\nyou got something\nfor me\nSomething you call\nlove, but con-\nfess,\nyes\n[B]You've been a messin'\nwhere you shouldn't have been a\nmessin'\nAnd now\n[F#]someone else is\ngettin' all your best\nThese\n\n[Chorus]\n[A]boots are made for\n[F#m]walking and\n[A]that's just what they'll\n[F#m]do\n[A]One of these days these\n[F#m]boots are gonna\n[C#]walk all over you\n[F#]\n[G]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[G]You keep lying,\nwhen you oughta be\ntruthin'\nAnd\nyou keep losin'\nwhen you oughta not\nbet\n[C]You keep samin'\nwhen you oughta be a\nchangin'\nNow what's\n[G]right is right and\nyou ain't been right,\nyet\nThese\n\n[Chorus]\n[A#]boots are made for\n[Gm]walking and\n[A#]that's just what they'll\n[Gm]do\n[A#]One of these days these\n[Gm]boots are gonna\n[D]walk all over you\n[G]\n[G#]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[G#]You keep playin'\nwhere you shouldn't be\nplayin'\nAnd\nyou keep thinkin'\nthat you'll never get\nburnt\n[C#]I've just found me a\nbrand new box of\nmatches,\nyeah And\n[G#]what he knows you\nain't had time to\nlearn\nThese\n\n[Chorus]\n[B]boots are made for\n[G#m]walking and\n[B]that's just what they'll\n[G#m]do\n[B]One of these days these\n[G#m]boots are gonna\n[D#]walk all over you\n\n[Outro]\n[G#]\nC'mon boots,\nlet's walk all over\nhim\n\n[Fade Out]\n[G#]",
